design_notes = "Normal gameplay routes Sprout through the shared ground-placement controller before spending mana. The summoned actor reads a PlantSummonDefinition for Broadleaf Sprout. Future discovered cactus, flytrap, tree, mushroom, and other species can reuse the same catalog/placement pipeline while supplying different actors and behavior profiles."
